OL,3,GNEWSAWhy we can't look away from
OL,4,Ahoarder home clean-ups
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Victoria Gordon arrives at a
OL,7,Fclient's house, she can be met with
OL,8,Fhuge piles of clothes, stacks of
OL,9,Funwashed dishes and badly blocked
OL,10,Ftoilets.
OL,12,FThe 44-year-old is not your average
OL,13,Fcleaner. She specialises in hoarder
OL,14,Fclearances, crime scene work and other
OL,15,Fextreme clean-up projects.
OL,17,FShe loves her job as an extreme
OL,18,Fcleaner, but since starting to document
OL,19,Fher cleaning adventures online, she has
OL,20,Ffound it fascinating how interested
OL,21,Fother people are in what she does.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
