OL,3,GNEWSAWhy we can't look away from
OL,4,Ahoarder home clean-ups
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe popularity of cleaning videos has
OL,7,Fgrown rapidly in recent years. In 2023,
OL,8,FUnilever partnered with TikTok to
OL,9,Flaunch a dedicated CleanTok community
OL,10,Fafter the genre had amassed 78 billion
OL,11,Fviews on the social media platform.
